## Projects.cpp/check_hostable
"" -> throws runtime_error: " cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"\xc3\xa9" -> throws runtime_error: "\xc3\xa9 cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"a b" -> throws runtime_error: "a b cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"a.b+c-d_e" -> throws runtime_error: "a.b+c-d_e cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"a/b" -> throws runtime_error: "a/b cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"a:b" -> throws runtime_error: "a:b cannot be hosted: a view takes its folder's name, and a name holds letters, digits, _ and -"
"wave" -> passes

## Projects.cpp/check_name
"" -> throws runtime_error: " is no project's name, which is letters, digits, _ and -; a path to a folder holds a /"
"\xc3\xa9" -> throws runtime_error: "\xc3\xa9 is no project's name, which is letters, digits, _ and -; a path to a folder holds a /"
"a b" -> throws runtime_error: "a b is no project's name, which is letters, digits, _ and -; a path to a folder holds a /"
"a-b_1" -> passes
"a.b" -> throws runtime_error: "a.b is no project's name, which is letters, digits, _ and -; a path to a folder holds a /"
"a/b" -> throws runtime_error: "a/b is no project's name, which is letters, digits, _ and -; a path to a folder holds a /"
"wave" -> passes
